leo's Rust runner

These files run Rust in the browser with Miri, the Rust interpreter. They are
taken unchanged from rubri (https://github.com/LyonSyonII/rubri, MIT) at the
commit in COMMIT: Miri compiled to WebAssembly (example/public/wasm-rustc/bin)
and the parts of the Rust standard library a plain program needs
(example/public/wasm-rustc/lib).

- rubri: MIT License.
- Miri (https://github.com/rust-lang/miri) and the Rust standard library
  (https://github.com/rust-lang/rust): MIT License or Apache License 2.0.
